# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional — Microsoft Translator (Azure AI Translator, free tier F0).
# Enables word-aligned translations: hover a word in either pane to highlight
# its equivalent in the other pane. Without a key the app falls back to the
# keyless MyMemory provider (no hover alignment).
#
# 1. Create a free Azure account: https://azure.microsoft.com/free
# 2. Create a "Translator" resource (free F0 tier, ~2M chars/month).
# 3. Copy its key here and set the region to the resource's region
#    (e.g. eastus, westeurope), or delete the region line if it is "global".
# MICROSOFT_TRANSLATOR_KEY=your-azure-translator-key
# MICROSOFT_TRANSLATOR_REGION=eastus
#
# Restart the dev server after changing these.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional — MyMemory Translation API free-tier boost.
# The app works with no key at all (anonymous ~500 chars/request, small daily quota).
# Register a free account at https://mymemory.translated.net and put its email
# address here to raise the limit to ~5,000 chars/request and a larger daily quota.
# MYMEMORY_EMAIL=you@example.com
